    "mechanism": "Drop a keep-fraction of ONE stream's loads. Unique bytes dropped are the catalog bytes of that stream times (1 - keep). Time delta over unique bytes is the stream's marginal cost. Defaulting a candidate to the organ-average GB/s is how the aux-u8 overcredit stayed invisible.",
